# First run: cp .env.example .env.personal
# .env.personal holds genuinely per-machine values (your own PORT if 3400 clashes,
# a personal DATABASE_URL). Everything shared ships encrypted in envs/.env.api.local.enc —
# if a value you need is missing there, that is a bug in the tier file, not a gap to fill
# personally. Decryption needs envs/.env.keys; get it from someone who already runs this app.
